  "status": "done",
  "notes": ""
 },
 {
  "id": "2588:9",
  "hdr": "0004 000D",
  "jp": "ぐぅ……{n}{col_F8}(ママさん、甘いです……)",
  "en": "Grr...{n}{col_F8}(Mama-san, you're too soft...)",
  "status": "done",
  "notes": ""
 },
 {
  "id": "2588:10",
  "hdr": "0007 000F",
  "jp": "ママったら、またナスカイザー{n}見てるの？",
  "en": "Mom, are you watching{n}Nazkaiser again?",
  "status": "done",
  "notes": ""
 },
 {
  "id": "2588:11",
  "hdr": "0008 0014",
  "jp": "……パワーをもらうのよ。",
  "en": "...It gives me strength.",
  "status": "done",
  "notes": ""
 },
 {
  "id": "2588:12",
  "hdr": "0008 0014",
  "jp": "この番組は過去につながっているの。",
  "en": "This show connects me to the past.",
  "status": "done",
  "notes": ""
 },
 {
  "id": "2588:13",
  "hdr": "0007 000F",
  "jp": "……ママ？",
  "en": "...Mom?",
  "status": "done",
  "notes": ""
 },
 {
  "id": "2588:14",
  "hdr": "0008 0014",
  "jp": "カナメくん。{n}{var_EF}{slot}{slot}{slot}{slot}{slot}くんのお父さんね。",
  "en": "Kaname-kun.{n}That's {var_EF}{slot}{slot}{slot}{slot}{slot}-kun's dad.",
  "status": "done",
  "notes": ""
 },
 {
  "id": "2588:15",
  "hdr": "0008 0014",
  "jp": "彼はいつもナスカイザーの話を{n}していたわ。",
  "en": "He was always talking{n}about Nazkaiser.",
  "status": "done",
  "notes": ""
 },
 {
  "id": "2588:16",
  "hdr": "0008 0014",
  "jp": "新しい必殺技を考えては{n}テレビ局に送ったりしてたの。",
  "en": "He'd dream up new finishing moves{n}and send them to the TV station.",
  "status": "done",
  "notes": ""
 },
 {
  "id": "2588:17",
  "hdr": "0007 000F",
  "jp": "ママ、それ、変な人だよ。",
  "en": "Mom, that makes him a weirdo.",
  "status": "done",
  "notes": ""
 },
 {
  "id": "2588:18",
  "hdr": "0008 0014",
  "jp": "そうね。{n}でも、ちゃんと採用されたのよ。",
  "en": "Yes, it does.{n}But they actually used his ideas.",
  "status": "done",
  "notes": ""
 },
 {
  "id": "2588:19",
  "hdr": "0008 0014",
  "jp": "いつでも本気だった。{n}いっしょうけんめいだった。",
  "en": "He always meant it.{n}He always gave it his all.",
  "status": "done",
  "notes": ""
 },
 {
  "id": "2588:20",
  "hdr": "0008 0014",
  "jp": "わたしもかなり影響をうけたわ。{n}何をするにも本気になった。",
  "en": "He had quite an effect on me too.{n}I put my heart into everything I did.",
  "status": "done",
  "notes": ""
 },
 {
  "id": "2588:21",
  "hdr": "0008 0014",
  "jp": "ナスカイザーを見ると、あの頃の{n}力を取り戻せるような気がするの。",
  "en": "Watching Nazkaiser makes me feel{n}like I can get back the strength{page}I had in those days.",
  "status": "done",
  "notes": ""
 },
 {
  "id": "2588:22",
  "hdr": "0007 000F",
  "jp": "ママ……",
  "en": "Mom...",
  "status": "done",
  "notes": ""
 },
 {
  "id": "2588:23",
  "hdr": "0008 0014",
  "jp": "……いってらっしゃい。{n}30分だけよ。",
